Description: Diagnose Linux AirPlay (RAOP) sender setup
 GTK4/libadwaita app that inspects the Linux AirPlay sender stack
 (Avahi, PipeWire RAOP, firewall/mDNS).
 .
 Linux can send audio to AirPlay speakers via RAOP (AirPlay 1) only.
 This package does not implement an AirPlay receiver or AirPlay 2 sending.
